---
const audiences = [
  "Home services and trades",
  "Clinics and local care practices",
  "Agencies with repeatable delivery",
  "Shops that sell services, not software",
];
---

<section id="who" class="border-t border-ink/10 py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">
        Who it's for
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
        If your day is calls, jobs, follow-ups, and a tangle of tools, you're in the right place.
        We skip enterprise theater and aim for systems your team will actually use on Tuesday morning.
      </p>
      <ul class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-lg space-y-3 text-left text-base text-ink-muted">
        {audiences.map((item) => (
          <li class="border-l-2 border-ember pl-4">{item}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
